    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the isalnd of thugs. This tropical island is a secret military base of the Russian PMC. You are a Special Agent who must find the leader of PMC and eliminate him. Take the gun and let's go!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Shooting Mechanics</strong>: Bullet drop and recoil are essential mechanics that enhance realism.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Levels</strong>: Diverse locations with cover, traps, and interactive elements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intelligent Enemy AI</strong>: Smart opponents with various tactics and behaviors.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Destructible Environments</strong>: Ability to destroy objects to get advantages.</p></li></ul>",
